  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145870",
      "title": "Configuring the \"head\" Content",
      "lectureOrder": 305,
      "videoOrder": 283,
      "sourceHash": "339fbce023ad30d79ec682c43f9a2101a27238aa481e90532fbcdf3aa6876db3",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 4.05,
          "en": "If you want to add content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.05,
          "end": 7.22,
          "en": "between the head tags on your page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.22,
          "end": 11.11,
          "en": "you can easily do that in Next.js applications",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.11,
          "end": 13.53,
          "en": "with help of a special component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.53,
          "end": 15.26,
          "en": "Let's say on our homepage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.26,
          "end": 18.97,
          "en": "so this Index.js file in the Pages folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.97,
          "end": 22.34,
          "en": "Let's say we wanna add extra information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.34,
          "end": 24.6,
          "en": "to that head section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.6,
          "end": 26.31,
          "en": "We can do that by importing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.31,
          "end": 29.83,
          "en": "a special component exposed by Next.js.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.83,
          "end": 34.83,
          "en": "The head component which we import from next/head like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.78,
          "end": 40.193,
          "en": "So where we imported link from next/link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.88,
          "end": 46.83,
          "en": "we now import head from next/head.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 46.83,
          "end": 50.89,
          "en": "That's a special component which you can add anywhere",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 50.89,
          "end": 54.87,
          "en": "in your JSX code for a given component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.87,
          "end": 58.36,
          "en": "So here we don't have to add it at the top level.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.36,
          "end": 60.77,
          "en": "We can go into the stiff here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 60.77,
          "end": 63.83,
          "en": "and add the head component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.83,
          "end": 67.16,
          "en": "And please note, it's Head written like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 67.16,
          "end": 68.8,
          "en": "with a capital H.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 68.8,
          "end": 71.31,
          "en": "It's not head written like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.31,
          "end": 74.9,
          "en": "This would not have the effect we want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.9,
          "end": 77.15,
          "en": "We need head written like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.1,
          "end": 80.37,
          "en": "because now you can add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 80.37,
          "end": 85.13,
          "en": "your typical head section HTML elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.13,
          "end": 90.13,
          "en": "between those special head tags and Next.js will inject them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.93,
          "end": 93.68,
          "en": "into the head section of the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 93.68,
          "end": 96.24000000000001,
          "en": "So if I, for example, add a title here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 96.24000000000001,
          "end": 100.05,
          "en": "which is a typical HTML element for the head section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 100.05,
          "end": 105.05,
          "en": "we could set the title to Next.js events here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.16,
          "end": 106.87,
          "en": "or whatever you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 106.87,
          "end": 109.07,
          "en": "And if you do so and save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.07,
          "end": 112.22,
          "en": "if you go back to the starting page, if I reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.22,
          "end": 115.97999999999999,
          "en": "you now see in the tab here it shows our title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.97999999999999,
          "end": 118.21000000000001,
          "en": "And if I inspected this page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 118.21000000000001,
          "end": 120.7,
          "en": "and I have a look at the head section here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.7,
          "end": 124.17,
          "en": "we indeed see the title was added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.17,
          "end": 127.76,
          "en": "So Next.js injects the content which we add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.76,
          "end": 131.57,
          "en": "between those head tags into the real head part",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 131.57,
          "end": 133.283,
          "en": "of the rendered page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 134.51,
          "end": 137.12,
          "en": "And of course we're not restricted to the title.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.12,
          "end": 141.55,
          "en": "We can also add meta tags here, meta elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 141.55,
          "end": 143.17000000000002,
          "en": "These can always be self-closing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.17000000000002,
          "end": 145.86,
          "en": "since they have no content between the tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 145.86,
          "end": 150.55,
          "en": "and then, for example, add our description tag here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 152.82999999999998,
          "end": 157.82999999999998,
          "en": "with a content of find a lot of great events",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.88,
          "end": 163.88,
          "en": "that allow you to evolve, whatever.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 163.88,
          "end": 164.85,
          "en": "Something like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 164.85,
          "end": 166.81,
          "en": "Maybe you'll find a better description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.81,
          "end": 169.3,
          "en": "but we can add such a meta tag here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.3,
          "end": 172,
          "en": "and now if we inspect the rendered page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172,
          "end": 175.71,
          "en": "we see that in the head now all those added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175.71,
          "end": 178.24,
          "en": "And that would be a special tag,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 178.24,
          "end": 181.38,
          "en": "this meta tag here with a name of description.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.38,
          "end": 185.27,
          "en": "That would be a tag which does matter to search engines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.27,
          "end": 188.32,
          "en": "because in the end this here, this description text",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 188.32,
          "end": 191.1,
          "en": "which we added to the content attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.1,
          "end": 194.72,
          "en": "that is the text that would show up in a search result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 194.72,
          "end": 198.5,
          "en": "when your page is showing up in Google search, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.5,
          "end": 203.1,
          "en": "So that matters and here between these special head tags,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.1,
          "end": 205.55,
          "en": "so instead of this special head element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 205.55,
          "end": 210.53,
          "en": "you can really add any HTML elements that would normally go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.53,
          "end": 213.14,
          "en": "into the head section of your page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.14,
          "end": 216.48,
          "en": "And that allows you to fine tune and configure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.48,
          "end": 219.313,
          "en": "what should show up in that head section.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
